    {
      "id": 3,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Hey! I'm good, how about you?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T13:34:05.628868+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Yeah! That's good to hear. What have you been up to lately? I'm always trying to catch up with my friends and family. Have you had any exciting adventures or hobbies recently?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T13:34:43.982000+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Wow, that's awesome. Have you been up to any interesting hobbies recently? What kind of activities are you into?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T13:35:25.247424+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Yeah, that sounds like a lot of fun. I've been into photography recently\u2014it's amazing to capture moments and memories in the great outdoors. Have you ever gone camping? It seems so peaceful and rewarding.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T13:36:12.244188+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Oh my! I never went camping, that's so cool. Do you like nature and camping?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T13:38:23.103172+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "That's cool! I love nature and the great outdoors. Do you have any recommendations for camping spots?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T13:39:51.127941+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "That's great to hear!",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T13:42:58.076203+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Great! I've been enjoying exploring new hobbies and interests. It feels like I'm really connecting with myself and getting to know me better.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T13:43:49.735971+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "I'm glad to hear that. I have been exploring different hobbies and interests lately. What are some activities you enjoy doing?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T13:46:26.001490+00:00"
    },
